      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "There are some well-related gallopers in this line-up. MYSTICAL (7) is first-up but looked handy winning the latest trial and is drawn to get all the favours from the inside alley. Looms as the main danger. MOVIE STAR (6) (half to G2 winner Robusto) has been thereabouts in all three career outings to date and gets the reliable Waller/McDonald combination from the low draw. In the mix. CHUCHICHASCHTLI (4) is facing the starter for the first time but is sure to be up to the mark out of the Hawkes barn. Keep safe. DOUBLE VISION (1) (full to G2 winner Seven Veils) returns from a spell. Prepared for this with a recent trial at Warwick Farm. Opened last campaign with a third at Randwick Kensington over 1150m. Major player. LOVE STORY (2) Justify mare from the mare Fix. Looked good when an easy trial winner and the stable has an impressive strike rate with the first starters. Respect any market confidence.",
